
Program name <:> Info.rexx
Author       <:> Jeepster (aka Tom Newsom)

I don't like doing .docs files...So here is all you get!

This is a simple file that shows a little info for the user as he/she logs
in to your system.

It shows the following info for the current user online -:

The current date.
The total number of system calls.
The users first call date.
The number of calls the user has made.
The users last call.
The total file & bytes the user has sent to your system.
The total number of messages the user has posted on your system.
The number of private & public messages the user has posted on your system.

Nothing stunning I will admit but it looks nice :)

I will admit not all the code is my own as I have taken some from one other
pfile (the author of which I can't remember).

Add it to your sys.welcome file as an arexx file. You'll also notice an
archive called fpwait02.lha unpack this and install it to pfiles: Info.rexx
needs this file to operate properly..(I hope you guys at Flux Point don't
mind me using this little program of yours)

Thats about all.

If you like this or better still use it. Mail me at 2:2502/61.0 and let me
know what you think :)

